{"id":"Wb38e5bcc96da5862494cef8b","zh":"矢长比","en":"","name":"矢长比","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb38e5bcc96da5862494cef8b","text":"矢长比","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sa9159a8f86e02dd16883","source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"课题组采用弦测法(弦长分别为3 ~8 m) 对滨洲线钢轨原始弯曲进行了现场实测,计算获得原始弯曲矢长比和原始弹性弯曲的相对曲率(由于是在8 月进行的测试, 塑性和弹性初弯可按原始弯曲矢度的一半考虑 [11]) 及其相应的平均值,并采用Savitzky -Golay 滤波算法对平均值进行了20 次的平滑处理 [12],滤波器窗宽取为5,滤波系数由不加权线性最小二乘回归和多项式模型确定,多项式模型的阶数取为3 阶。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"Sa0ef1a2fb01a037f9db7","source_id":"P104","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"原始弯曲矢长比的平均值,方差和标准差分别为4.70 × 10 -4,2.31 × 10 -4和1.52 × 10 -4,原始弹性弯曲相对曲率的平均值,方差和标准差分别为4.71 × -5 m -1,2.67 × 10 -5 m -2和1.63 × 10 -5 m -1。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"原始弯曲矢度与测量弦长之比，用于表征初弯程度。","language":"zh","source_id":"P104","paper_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wc4dba935ad555c0e9ebe35c1","name":"Ratio of vector to wavelength","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wc4dba935ad555c0e9ebe35c1","name":"Ratio of vector to wavelength","lan